    },
    {
      "voiceId": "zuby",
      "voiceName": "Zuby",
      "platform": "x",
      "text": "Marriage rates are going to keep dropping in the West. I don't see them reversing anytime soon.\n\nPeople can't even agree on what 'marriage' means anymore. There are all these different interpretations, expectations, and permutations.\n\nIt's deranging. Tough sell for many.",
      "sourceUrl": "https://x.com/ZubyMusic/status/2052801653795860693",
      "timestamp": "2026-05-08T17:23:48+00:00",
      "type": "tweet"
    },
    {
      "voiceId": "zuby",
      "voiceName": "Zuby",
      "platform": "x",
      "text": "I'm amused by this idea that prior to 'capitalism', people didn't have to work to survive.\n\n\nS.\ud83c\udfa7 (@1ssve)\n\nCapitalism makes quitting your job feel like risking your life, because it ties your basic survival needs to staying employed. This system is predatory.\n\n\n\n\u2014 https://nitter.net/1ssve/status/2052040328048505307#m",
